  -H 'X-Auth-Token: <auth_token>' \
  -d '{
  "resources": {
    "vnf-1": {
      "type": "OS::Heat::ResourceGroup",
      "properties": {
        "count": 1,
        "resource": {
          "type": "OS::Nova::Server",
          "properties": {
            "image": "ubuntu-18.04",
            "flavor": "m1.small"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}'
```
This closed-loop assurance scenario enables the OSS system to continuously monitor the network and make adjustments in real-time to ensure optimal performance and service quality, resulting in improved customer experience and reduced downtime.

