```
service L3VPN {
  description "MPLS L3VPN service";
  container sites {
    list site {
      key site-id;
      description "Customer site";
      leaf site-id {
        type string;
      }
      container ip-addresses {
        list ip-address {
          key ip-address;
          description "IP address of the site";
          leaf ip-address {
            type inet:ip-address;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

This YANG model defines a service L3VPN with a container for sites, which contains a list of sites, each with a unique site ID and a container for IP addresses. This hierarchical structure allows for easy representation of the relationships between the L3VPN service and its connected customer sites.

