        match {
            protocol = (http | https);
            destination = "facebook.com";
            port = (80 | 443);
        }
        action = allow;
    }
}
```

This configuration will block Facebook chat traffic (XMPP) while allowing Facebook web traffic (HTTP/HTTPS) to pass through.

