```
netconf-server {
    idle-timeout 300;
    ssh-listen-address 0.0.0.0 830;
}
```
On the device side, the Call Home configuration is typically done using the "netconf-call-home" feature, which specifies the NMS's IP address and port, as well as the transport protocol (SSH) and the frequency of the call-home events, as shown in the following example:
```
netconf-call-home {
