- 40Gbps Ethernet (40G-ETH) mapped into OPU4 (9.953 Gbps) or OPU5 (11.095 Gbps) using the G.709 G.709-1.1 mapping;
- 100Gbps Ethernet (100G-ETH) mapped into OPU6 (11.095 Gbps) or OPU7 (11.667 Gbps) using the G.709 G.709-1.1 mapping;
- STM-64 (Synchronous Transport Module-64) mapped into OPU1 (2.488 Gbps) or OPU2 (2.666 Gbps) using the G.709 G.709-1.1 mapping;
