`network slicing {
  slice-profile connected-agriculture {
    description "Connected Agriculture Slice in North America";
    location "North America";
    strict-isolation false;
  }
}`

This configuration removes the strict resource isolation requirement for the connected agriculture mMTC slice in North America, allowing for more flexible resource allocation and sharing among slices.

