To set the ARP pre-emption capability for the factory floor control URLLC slice in Middle-East to 'not_preempt_capable', you can use the following ETSI NFV-SOL005 API command: 

`POST /vnf-instances/{vnfInstanceId}/policies HTTP/1.1` with the request body containing the policy update with the 'arp_preemption_capability' set to 'not_preempt_capable'. 

```json
{
  "policy": {
    "arp_preemption_capability": "not_preempt_capable"
  }
}
```

This command updates the policy of the specified VNF instance to set the ARP pre-emption capability to 'not_preempt_capable' for the factory floor control URLLC slice in Middle-East.

